GTK+ has an inheritance hierarchy and polymorphic functions - by which I 
mean functions which operate on a GtkWidget which may actually be more 
specialised. But it also uses typecasts everywhere (disguised by 
#defines) so it may not fit precisely your definition of OO. In 
addition, inheriting from classes is awkward.

